# A deliberately broken telegram, for the failure path of
# evc_s076_check: Q_UPDOWN is 0 (down-link) on the wire, which our
# on-board rejects (up-link only, 7.5.1.142) -- Bad_Header. Same bits
# otherwise as sv1/valid.scn's telegram, packet 0 included, so the
# "var" rows past the header would still match if the decode did not
# already fail on the header.
sequence broken header
case Q_UPDOWN down-link
step balise group read
text: a telegram whose Q_UPDOWN is wrong
telegram 1 1 1/1 0 bits 210 2000028020008003ffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffc0
var Q_UPDOWN 1 0
var M_VERSION 7 32
var Q_MEDIA 1 0
var N_PIG 3 0
var N_TOTAL 3 0
var M_DUP 2 0
var M_MCOUNT 8 5
var NID_C 10 1
var NID_BG 14 1
var Q_LINK 1 0
var NID_PACKET 8 0
var NID_VBCMK 6 3
var NID_PACKET 8 255
result: rejected (Bad_Header)
